  "title": "Quick Right-Click",
  "description": "✋ Adds a portable functionality to certain items, which allows for quick access without placement. Works with beds, crafting tables, ender chests and shulker boxes among others.",
  "body": "<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"About the mod\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Quick Right-Click is a QoL mod which enables players to quickly access many functional blocks without having to place them down. Just right-click the item in the air, without targeting a block. Quickly sleep in a bed, access your ender chest or open shulker boxes. Some will be opened directly, others placed down automatically. See the example GIFs below for a better idea of how it works.<br><br>Works for:<br>Beds, Cartography Tables, Crafting Tables, Ender Chests, Grindstones, Shulker Boxes, Smithing Tables and Stonecutters.</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"Included in The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"Included in Serilum's QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"Environment: Server\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;All available config options:</p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enableQuickBeds</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If right-clicking beds in the air should enable the quick feature.<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickCartographyTables</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If right-clicking cartography tables in the air should enable the quick feature.<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickCraftingTables</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If right-clicking crafting tables in the air should enable the quick feature.<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickEnderChests</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If right-clicking ender chests in the air should enable the quick feature.<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickGrindstones</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If right-clicking grindstones in the air should enable the quick feature.<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickShulkerBoxes</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If right-clicking shulker boxes in the air should enable the quick feature.<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickSmithingTables</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If right-clicking smithing tables in the air should enable the quick feature.<br><br><span><strong>enableQuickStonecutters</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;default true<br>If right-clicking stonecutters in the air should enable the quick feature.</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"Showcase\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>Quickly sleep in a bed. It'll be placed down and picked up automatically once done sleeping.</p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>Quickly access your ender chest, without the need for silk touch to pick it back up.</p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>Open Shulker Boxes quickly, access its contents and be on your way.</p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>Craft items quickly without leaving crafting tables everywhere you go.</p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>Also works for cartography tables, and the other village profession blocks.</p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/e.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>You may freely use this mod in any modpack, as long as the download remains hosted within the CurseForge or Modrinth ecosystem.</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> contains an overview and more information on all mods available.</span><br><span><br>For issues, ideas, suggestions or anything else there is the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github repo</a>. Thanks!</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
